<title>JAPAN: Izumi Industries - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Izumi Industries - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 14.20		vs	   14.35</p>
<p> Operating	  195    million    vs	  569    million</p>
<p> Current	    109    million    vs	  373    million</p>
<p> Net	     loss 5.63		vs	prft 141 million</p>
<p> EPS	   loss 369.24 yen	  vs     prft 9.28 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     15 million	  vs	  15 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Izumi Industries Ltd is a large maker of pistons for diesel engines.</p>
</text>
